; AdaptiveMultiStrategyEA - gold trend sleeve, SMALL setting (about 0.2 x Kelly on the 20-year Sharpe of 0.5). No stop.
; Rule (unchanged since chapter 93): hold gold while its daily close is above the 200-day average, reviewed every 7 days. Long only.
; No specific days and no time-of-day habits are used for decisions.
; For the OANDA commodity CFD account (a separate sub-account; account leverage 1:100, gold margin 5%). Attach to an XAUUSD chart (H1).
; Numbers below: MT5 tester on OANDA's own data with the account's real leverage, JPY 3,000,000, measured on daily equity (chapter 105).
;   last 3 years, real ticks (Nov 2023 - Nov 2026): +69% (+19% per year), drawdown 10%, best 12 months +50%, worst -1%.
;   2007 - 2026 (20 years, M1 OHLC): +175% (+5% per year), Sharpe 0.56, drawdown 34%, worst 12 months -18%.
;   It lost in 2012-2018 every year (-2% to -10%) and in 2021-2022; it earns only while gold keeps trending.
